  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Performance sphere ((lyric) package).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your lyrics do not automatically end the effects of other lyrics (unless you choose to), allowing you to have multiple lyrics active on a single creature as long as they originate from different sources.</p>\n<p>Additionally, an ally that is affected by one of your lyrics can spend a swift action to harmonize with the lyric, imparting its benefits to another creature within your lyric range to the ally (Will negates if unwilling). A lyric imparted this way cannot be expended, only lasts for 1 round, but can still be harmonized as normal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
